{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34221","headline":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 钓矶 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 钓矶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拣得白云根，秋潮未曾没。\n坡陁坐鳌背，散漫垂龙髪。\n持竿从掩雾，置酒复待月。\n即此放神情，何劳适吴越。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}